node_modules/: Dependencies; huge (millions of files), machine-specific, reinstalled with npm install.
​

Build outputs like dist/, build/, .next/: Generated by bundlers (Webpack, Next.js); rebuild locally.
​

Config caches: .eslintcache, .stylelintcache, npm-debug.log*, yarn-error.log*.
​

Environment files: .env* (secrets like API keys); share .env.example instead.
​

IDE files: .vscode/ settings (if personal), .DS_Store (Mac).
​

Your screenshot lists: node_modules, acorn, clean, eslintrc, js-yaml modules—these are all caches/ignores.
​